      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The paper reports on the authors' experience in the surgical emergency of a special category of patients: pregnant women with acute affections requiring surgery. The clinical aspects, sometimes deceptive, diagnosis difficulties and tactile and technical surgical attitudes are presented in detail."},
